<title>FRANCE: Blocks of Carrefour,Paribas trade.</title>
<headline>Blocks of Carrefour,Paribas trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blocks of Paribas and Carrefour shares were traded on the Paris bourse on Tuesday, market sources said.</p>
<p>They said a block of 242,600 shares in Carrefour, representing 0.6 percent of its capital, was traded at 0934 GMT at 3,430 francs per share. A block of 400,000 Paribas shares, representing 0.3 percent of the capital, was traded at 356.50 francs per share at 0925 GMT.</p>
<p>Carrefour's stock was down 1.23 percent at 3,378 francs at 1134 GMT, and Paribas shares were 1.51 percent lower at 351.60 francs. The CAC-40 index was down 1.2 percent at the same time.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
